      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Contestant One bites his lower lip before speaking. While speaking, his eyes move from right to left and back twice. His head moves slightly side to side and then up and down. After speaking, he closes his lips tightly and blinks after saying Charles."
