              "text": "The host reads the signed statement attributed to Charles Hickson. The statement summarizes the Pascagoula account, including the fishing setting, the craft, the beings, the examination, the return, hypnosis, and the lie detector test. The segment ends with signed Charles Hickson, marking the story as Hickson's written testimony even though it is voiced by the host."
            }
